      "content": "i get that \"scientific research\" might not have caught up yet, but it felt too specific to just be anxiety. it wasn't just a racing heart, it was like a physical resonance, like a frequency. if i'm actually picking up on these micro-fluctuations through my own biology, how would i actually go about measuring that? like, is there a way to track my vitals against specific high-frequency trade patterns to see if there's a quantifiable correlation?",
